# ============================================================
# ChatKu API Tests - Enkripsi & Kunci RSA
# Gunakan dengan ekstensi "REST Client" di VS Code
# ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://192.168.1.22:8000/api/v1
@userId1  = 69b821eaab69f25c1b35dfae
@userId2  = 69e2050b5c53a541d05fa1c1

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LANGKAH 1: Login → dapatkan token
# (Isi OTP dulu lewat Twilio / email, lalu jalankan verify-otp)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1a. Kirim OTP ke nomor/email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "email",
  "value": "dimas_kurniawan009@student.pnl.ac.id"
}

###

### 1b. Verifikasi OTP → dapat access_token
# Setelah menerima token, copy ke variabel @token di bawah
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "email",
  "value": "dimas_kurniawan009@student.pnl.ac.id",
  "otp_code": "901613"
}

###

# ─── Isi token dari response di atas ────────────────────────
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI2OWYxNjBiZTFlNGExNDNkNzYxYTIxNGYiLCJleHAiOjE3ODAwMTg2MjIsImlhdCI6MTc3NzQyNjYyMiwidHlwZSI6ImFjY2VzcyJ9.yOkFRonFk340-u-61qHL8x6FyrNHIy-Pwg8lF7TEc3s

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LANGKAH 2: Cek public key server
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 2. GET /security/server-public-key
# Perhatikan apakah hasilnya "BEGIN PUBLIC KEY" (SPKI) atau "BEGIN RSA PUBLIC KEY" (PKCS#1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/security/server-public-key
Content-Type: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LANGKAH 3: Cek public key milik USER (penerima pesan)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3. GET /users/{userId2}/public-key
# Ini adalah kunci yang dipakai untuk enkripsi saat mengirim pesan ke user lain
# Perhatikan format keynya: "BEGIN PUBLIC KEY" atau "BEGIN RSA PUBLIC KEY"?
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId2}}/public-key
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LANGKAH 4: Cek public key PENGIRIM (diri sendiri)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4. GET /users/{userId1}/public-key
# Ini kunci yang dipakai untuk enkripsi encryptedSenderKey (agar pengirim bisa baca pesannya sendiri)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId1}}/public-key
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LANGKAH 5: Cek profil saya (pastikan login berhasil)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 5. GET /users/me
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LANGKAH 6: Upload public key baru (format SPKI) — jika perlu reset
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 6. POST /users/me/public-key (upload ulang key dalam format SPKI)
# Gunakan jika key lama masih PKCS#1 dan perlu diganti manual
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/public-key
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "public_key": "-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----\nMIIBIjANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQEFAAOCAQ8AMIIBCgKCAQEA...\n-----END PUBLIC KEY-----"
}

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# LANGKAH 7: Test kirim pesan dual-encrypted ke chatId tertentu
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7. GET daftar chat (cari chatId yang ingin ditest)
GET {{baseUrl}}/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

# ─── Isi chatId dari response di atas ───────────────────────
@chatId = GANTI_DENGAN_CHAT_ID

### 8. POST kirim pesan dual-encrypted
# Ini menguji apakah endpoint backend menerima format payload yang benar
POST {{baseUrl}}/chats/{{chatId}}/messages/dual-encrypted
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "encrypted_content_user": "TEST_CIPHERTEXT_USER",
  "encrypted_content_server": "TEST_CIPHERTEXT_SERVER",
  "encrypted_aes_key_user": "TEST_AES_KEY_USER",
  "encrypted_aes_key_sender": "TEST_AES_KEY_SENDER",
  "encrypted_aes_key_server": "TEST_AES_KEY_SERVER",
  "iv": "TEST_IV_BASE64",
  "message_hash": "TEST_HASH",
  "type": "text"
}

###
